        "en": "SIMULATION / 模拟 — DRAFT / 草案. The current simulation log says support resources are sufficient and there is no current disruption at this time. No flight-specific delay or cancellation is confirmed. Please check official airline and airport updates for your flight; do not rely on this draft as a final status.",
        "zh": "模拟 / SIMULATION — 草案 / DRAFT。当前模拟日志显示保障资源充足，目前没有运行中断。尚未确认具体航班的延误或取消。请查看航空公司及机场的官方更新；不要将本草案视为最终状态。"
